    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race the clock, outsmart your rivals, win the qualifiers, and take on the ultimate challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why play ROAD TO EXOTICS?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300+ racers simultaneously:</strong> Racing chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True arcade racer:</strong> Relive the golden era of racing games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your collection:</strong> Drive monsters and exotic cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Race Modes:</strong> Take on both classic and timed checkpoint challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic soundtrack:</strong> Retro-inspired tunes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy controls:</strong> Accelerate, steer,\u00a0and\u00a0brake. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552000/extras/39ac8393c824e689cebc563614f15cfe.avif?t=1751732365\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race the clock, outsmart your rivals, win the qualifiers, and take on the ultimate challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why play ROAD TO EXOTICS?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300+ racers simultaneously:</strong> Racing chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True arcade racer:</strong> Relive the golden era of racing games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your collection:</strong> Drive monsters and exotic cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Race Modes:</strong> Take on both classic and timed checkpoint challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic soundtrack:</strong> Retro-inspired tunes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy controls:</strong> Accelerate, steer,\u00a0and\u00a0brake. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552000/extras/39ac8393c824e689cebc563614f15cfe.avif?t=1751732365\" /></span></p>",
